category: Libs
build-depends: cygport gcc-fortran libevent-devel libhwloc-devel liblevel-zero-devel libopenmpi-devel openmpi zlib-devel
sdesc: "Dynamic execution environments for coupled, thread-heterogeneous MPI+X applications (utilities)"
ldesc: "QUO (as in 'status quo') is a runtime library that aids in accommodating
thread-level heterogeneity in dynamic, phased MPI+X applications comprising
single- and multi-threaded libraries."
